//! What the control room looks like: sizes, colours, durations
//! (`dev-docs/poltergeist/control-room.md`, 3.5).
//!
//! **GENERATED. Do not edit this file.** It is written from
//! `src/input/control-room-look.json` by `python3 tools/gen-control-room-look.py --write`;
//! change the data and run that. `tools/the-control-room-look-is-one-set.py`
//! fails when this file is not what the data says. The macOS host has the
//! same data as `ControlRoomLook.swift`, written by the same run.
//!
//! Lengths are logical points and times are seconds. These are readings off
//! the design, not off a product.

